Hi=20Fernanda,=20list,

RTFM!=20=20Open=20the=20online=20help,=20select=20the=20search=20tab=20and=
=20type=20"qq-plot".=20=20One=20
of=20the=20pages=20suggested=20is=20for=20the=20Model=20Definition=20prope=
rties:=20"Diagnostics=20
-=20Detection=20Function=20Tab=20-=20CDS=20and=20MCDS".=20=20On=20this=20p=
age,=20it=20says:

--

K-S=20test=20goodness-of-fit=20test=20and=20qq=20plots
------------------------------------------

Note!=20This=20option=20is=20only=20relevant=20if=20you=20are=20analyzing=20=
the=20data=20as=20exact=20
distances.

Qq=20plots=20are=20a=20graphical=20technique=20for=20assessing=20the=20ade=
quacy=20of=20the=20fit,=20
and=20the=20associated=20test=20statistics=20(Kolmogorov-Smirnov=20and=20C=
ram=82r-von=20Mises)=20
test=20goodness-of-fit=20for=20exact=20data.=20=20For=20more=20about=20the=
se=20outputs,=20see=20
Chapter=208=20-=20Conventional=20Distance=20Sampling=20Analysis.

Since=20these=20outputs=20can=20take=20a=20while=20to=20generate=20for=20l=
arge=20datasets,=20there=20
is=20an=20option=20here=20to=20turn=20them=20off.=20=20Qq=20plots=20have=20=
one=20plotted=20point=20per=20
observation,=20so=20for=20large=20datasets=20it=20is=20better=20to=20plot=20=
only=20a=20subset=20of=20
points.=20=20By=20default,=20the=20maximum=20number=20of=20points=20to=20p=
lot=20is=20500,=20but=20that=20
can=20be=20changed=20here.=20=20Entering=200=20under=20Maximum=20num=20poi=
nts=20in=20qq=20plots=20means=20
that=20all=20points=20are=20plotted,=20regardless=20of=20how=20many=20ther=
e=20are.

--

I'll=20add=20some=20extra=20pointers=20to=20this=20page=20so=20it's=20easi=
er=20to=20find=20from=20the=20
other=20help=20pages=20on=20qq-plots.

